       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.

       PROGRAM-ID.     CCATOVRUP.
       AUTHOR.         EXLTECH, LLC - DAN RAUCH

      *****************************************************************
      **                    C C A T O V R U P
      **      -------------------------------------------------
      **   REMOVE\ADD CATALOG ITEM PREFERRENCE OVERRIDES
      *****************************************************************

      *****************************************************************
      **            M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *   SEPT  15 2003      DAN RAUCH
      *   INITIAL AUTHOR   XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX  'G
      *   XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX  'G
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
                                                                       *
      *================================================================
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      *================================================================

       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

       SOURCE-COMPUTER.       IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.       IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.         LOCAL-DATA IS LDA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

      *============================================================    ====
      *=== CATALOG FILE BY CORPCODE                                    ====
      *============================================================    ====
           SELECT CATALOG-FILE       ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLAB2005
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.

      *============================================================    ====
      *=== CATALOG OVERRIDE FILE BY CORPCODE                           ====
      *============================================================    ====
           SELECT OVERRIDE-FILE      ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLAB2702
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.

      *============================================================    ====
       DATA DIVISION.
      *============================================================    ====
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  CATALOG-FILE.
       01  CATALOG-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLAB2005.
       COPY DARIBACAT   IN COPYLIB.


       FD  OVERRIDE-FILE.
       01  OVERRIDE-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLAB2702.
       COPY DARIBAOVR   IN COPYLIB.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------

      *****************************************************************
      * FILE STATUS AREA
      *****************************************************************
       COPY FILESTATUS  IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DTSPARMS2   IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************    ****
      *  JUST WORK FIELDS
      *************************************************************    ****
       01  WS-MISCELLANEOUS-FIELDS.

           03  WS-SAVE-REASON-CODE    PIC X(04)   VALUE SPACE.
           03  WS-SAVE-CORP-CODE      PIC X(08)   VALUE SPACE.
           03  WS-SAVE-CATALOG-REC    PIC X(400)  VALUE SPACE.


      *=============================================================== ==
      *===        L I N K A G E    S E C T I O N                       =
      *=============================================================== =
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LS-PGM-MODE               PIC X(01).
       01  LS-CATALOG-REC            PIC X(400).

      *=============================================================== ==
      *===        P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N                 =
      *=============================================================== =
       PROCEDURE DIVISION  USING  LS-PGM-MODE  LS-CATALOG-REC.
       0000-PROGRAM-ENTRY.

           OPEN   I-O     OVERRIDE-FILE
                          CATALOG-FILE.

           PERFORM 0010-INITIALIZE    THRU 0010-EXIT.

           PERFORM 1000-MAIN-LOGIC    THRU 1000-EXIT.

           CLOSE          OVERRIDE-FILE
                          CATALOG-FILE.

         0000-PROGRAM-END.
             GOBACK.

      ***************************************************************  *
      * PROGRAM INIT ROUTINE
      ***************************************************************  *
       0010-INITIALIZE.

           MOVE LS-CATALOG-REC       TO WS-SAVE-CATALOG-REC
                                        BUF-DARIBCAT.

           MOVE ARIBACAT-CORP-CODE   TO WS-SAVE-CORP-CODE.
           MOVE ARIBACAT-REASON-CODE TO WS-SAVE-REASON-CODE.

       0010-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ***************************************************************  **
      * MAIN LOGIC
      ***************************************************************  **
       1000-MAIN-LOGIC.

           IF  LS-PGM-MODE = "1"
               PERFORM 1100-RMV-OLD-OVERRIDE THRU 1100-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF  LS-PGM-MODE = "2"
               PERFORM 1100-RMV-OLD-OVERRIDE THRU 1100-EXIT
               PERFORM 1200-ADD-NEW-OVERRIDE THRU 1200-EXIT
           END-IF.

       1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ***************************************************************  **
      * DELETE THE OLD OVERRIDE RECORD
      ***************************************************************  **
       1100-RMV-OLD-OVERRIDE.

      *================================================================
      * REMOVE THE CURRENT OVERRIDE FOR THIS CORPCODE
      *    @@ DELETE OVERRIDE RECORD
      *    @@ UPDATE CATALOG FILE
      *       -- INIT REASON CODE & OVERRIDE FLAG
      *================================================================
           INITIALIZE   BUF-DARIBOVR.
           MOVE WS-SAVE-CORP-CODE     TO ARIBAOVR-CORP-CODE.

           PERFORM 9001-READK-OVERRIDE THRU 9001-READK-EXIT.
           IF  FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               GO TO 1100-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE BUF-DARIBOVR TO BUF-DARIBCAT.

           PERFORM 9001-DELET-OVERRIDE THRU 9001-DELET-EXIT.

           PERFORM 9000-READK-CATALOG  THRU 9000-READK-EXIT.
           IF  FS-GOOD-FILE-IO
               MOVE SPACE         TO ARIBACAT-OVRD-FLAG
               MOVE SPACE         TO ARIBACAT-REASON-CODE
               PERFORM 9000-REWRT-CATALOG  THRU 9000-REWRT-EXIT
           END-IF.

       1100-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ***************************************************************  **
      * ADD THE NEW OVERRIDE
      ***************************************************************  **
       1200-ADD-NEW-OVERRIDE.

      *================================================================
      * APPLY THE NEW OVERRIDE
      *    @@ WRITE NEW OVERRIDE RECORD FOR THIS CORPCODE
      *    @@ UPDATE THE CATALOG RECORD FOR THIS CORPCODE
      *       -- POPULATE REASON CODE AND OVERRIDE FLAG
      *================================================================
           INITIALIZE   BUF-DARIBOVR.
           MOVE WS-SAVE-CORP-CODE  TO ARIBAOVR-CORP-CODE.
           PERFORM 9001-READK-OVERRIDE THRU 9001-READK-EXIT.
           IF  FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               MOVE  WS-SAVE-CATALOG-REC  TO BUF-DARIBOVR
               MOVE "Y"          TO ARIBAOVR-ACTIVE-FLAG
               PERFORM 9001-WRITE-OVERRIDE THRU 9001-WRITE-EXIT
           END-IF.


           MOVE  WS-SAVE-CATALOG-REC  TO BUF-DARIBCAT.
           PERFORM 9000-READK-CATALOG  THRU 9000-READK-EXIT.
           IF  FS-GOOD-FILE-IO
               MOVE "Y"          TO ARIBACAT-OVRD-FLAG
               MOVE WS-SAVE-REASON-CODE  TO ARIBACAT-REASON-CODE
               PERFORM 9000-REWRT-CATALOG  THRU 9000-REWRT-EXIT
           END-IF.

       1200-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *
      *          ALL DATABASE FILE I-O'S BELOW THIS POINT
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------

      *****************************************************************
      **  READ CATALOG  FILE  BY KEY
      *****************************************************************
       9000-READK-CATALOG.

           READ CATALOG-FILE
           END-READ.

       9000-READK-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  REWRITE CATALOG FILE OUT
      *****************************************************************
       9000-REWRT-CATALOG.

           CALL "GETDTSTMP2" USING WS-SYSTEM-DATE-TIME2.
           MOVE WS-SYSTEM-DATE-TIME2  TO  ARIBACAT-DATE-TIME-STMP.

           REWRITE  CATALOG-REC
           END-REWRITE.

       9000-REWRT-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      **  READ OVERRIDE FILE  BY KEY
      *****************************************************************
       9001-READK-OVERRIDE.

           READ   OVERRIDE-FILE
           END-READ.

       9001-READK-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      **  DELETE OVERRIDE FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9001-DELET-OVERRIDE.

           DELETE OVERRIDE-FILE
           END-DELETE.

       9001-DELET-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      **  WRITE OVERRIDE FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9001-WRITE-OVERRIDE.

           WRITE  OVERRIDE-REC
           END-WRITE.

       9001-WRITE-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      **  REWRITE OVERRIDE FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9001-REWRT-OVERRIDE.

           REWRITE  OVERRIDE-REC
           END-REWRITE.

       9001-REWRT-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      **************************************************************   ***
      *            E N D   O F   S O U R C E   C O D E
      **************************************************************   ***
